abstract: >-
  Open-source AI career copilot: resume readiness analysis, JD matching,
  interview practice, and research-paper Q&A with citations. Privacy-first:
  no-LLM, BYOK, and local (Ollama) modes. Built with Flask, TF-IDF/BM25
  retrieval, and multi-provider LLM gateway.
